{"id":"d3c2290aa1563742","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier.md","title":"Theorem — 切片中的子对象分类子","display":"Theorem — 切片中的子对象分类子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier","aliases":["14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier"],"display":"Theorem — 切片中的子对象分类子","source_ref":"IV.7, pp.190–191","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-slice-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 切片中的子对象分类子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.7, pp.190–191"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 有有限极限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}:1\\to\\Omega)\">\\((\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}:1\\to\\Omega)\\)</span> 为子对象分类子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_B:\\Omega\\times B\\to B\">\\(\\pi_B:\\Omega\\times B\\to B\\)</span> 为投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:(S,q)\\hookrightarrow(A,p)\">\\(m:(S,q)\\hookrightarrow(A,p)\\)</span> 为切片单态射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_0=b_B(m):S\\to A\">\\(m_0=b_B(m):S\\to A\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a> 的底层箭头提取，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{m_0}:A\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\chi_{m_0}:A\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为其环境分类映射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_B\">\\(t_B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi^B_m\">\\(\\chi^B_m\\)</span> 为以下定义的带切片源、靶的箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_B=((B,\\operatorname{id}_B),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\operatorname{true}\\circ!_B,\\operatorname{id}_B\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_B=((B,\\operatorname{id}_B),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\operatorname{true}\\circ!_B,\\operatorname{id}_B\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi^B_m=((A,p),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\chi_{m_0},p\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi^B_m=((A,p),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\chi_{m_0},p\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E/B}\\bigl((\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),t_B\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E/B}\\bigl((\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),t_B\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_B\\circ b_B(\\chi^B_m)=p,\\qquad b_B(\\chi^B_m)\\circ m_0=b_B(t_B)\\circ q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_B\\circ b_B(\\chi^B_m)=p,\\qquad b_B(\\chi^B_m)\\circ m_0=b_B(t_B)\\circ q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>切片单态射的底层箭头是单态射：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_0u=m_0v\">\\(m_0u=m_0v\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"qu=pm_0u=pm_0v=qv\">\\(qu=pm_0u=pm_0v=qv\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 加上同一源对象标签后成为可比切片箭头，故可消去。反向显然。环境分类方块与基底箭头配对，得到切片分类方块；其泛性质仍来自环境拉回，并且因子箭头自动在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上。任意切片分类箭头的第二分量被固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，第一分量由环境分类子唯一性固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{m_0}\">\\(\\chi_{m_0}\\)</span>，故分类映射唯一。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，IV.7, pp.190–191。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 有有限极限，$(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}:1\\to\\Omega)$ 为子对象分类子，$B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\pi_B:\\Omega\\times B\\to B$ 为投影，$m:(S,q)\\hookrightarrow(A,p)$ 为切片单态射；$m_0=b_B(m):S\\to A$ 为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的底层箭头提取，$\\chi_{m_0}:A\\to\\Omega$ 为其环境分类映射。$t_B$、$\\chi^B_m$ 为以下定义的带切片源、靶的箭头。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}:1\\to\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_B:\\Omega\\times B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"m:(S,q)\\hookrightarrow(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"m_0=b_B(m):S\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{m_0}:A\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"t_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi^B_m","display":false},{"tex":"t_B=((B,\\operatorname{id}_B),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\operatorname{true}\\circ!_B,\\operatorname{id}_B\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi^B_m=((A,p),(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),\\langle\\chi_{m_0},p\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{\\mathcal E/B}\\bigl((\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B),t_B\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_B\\circ b_B(\\chi^B_m)=p,\\qquad b_B(\\chi^B_m)\\circ m_0=b_B(t_B)\\circ q.","display":true},{"tex":"m_0u=m_0v","display":false},{"tex":"qu=pm_0u=pm_0v=qv","display":false},{"tex":"u,v","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{m_0}","display":false}],"bytes":2077,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier|thm-217 — 切片中的子对象分类子]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier|thm-217 — 切片中的子对象分类子]]"},{"id":"4d7f855ae975e0f6","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，$f:A\\to B$；切片均为[[14-thm-slice-power-object]]的拓扑斯。$f^*,\\Sigma_f,\\Pi_f$ 采用[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]–[[14-df-dependent-product]]。分类子对象 $\\Omega_B=(\\Omega\\times B,\\pi_B)$、$\\Omega_A=(\\Omega\\times A,\\pi_A)$ 及真箭头 $t_B,t_A$ 采用[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]。$\\zeta:f^*\\Omega_B\\to\\Omega_A$ 为拉回对象到 $\\Omega\\times A$ 的唯一配对箭头，底层分量是原 $\\Omega$ 投影和新 $A$ 投影。$\\upsilon:f^*1_B\\xrightarrow{\\sim}1_A$ 是[[14-df-base-change-dependent-sum]]拉回构造给出的唯一终对象同构。"},{"id":"abee8603b9a8b54a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，固定分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$、有限极限与指数；$B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。切片与底层箭头投影 $b_B$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]，切片分类子见[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]。$P=(C,p:C\\to B)$、$Q=(Z,q:Z\\to B)$ 是切片对象。$P_C=\\Omega^C$，$\\operatorname{ev}_C:P_C\\times C\\to\\Omega$；$\\lambda_C$ 是以 $C$ 为指数参数的转置。$\\delta_B$ 是下式定义的对角分类箭头，$\\chi_m$ 采用 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]]。下式中的各 $\\pi$ 均为相应已选积投影；$\\Theta_{P,Q}$ 中的 $(-)^{-1}$ 为 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像函数。"}],"outgoing":["a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","7cd6386b14d5d667"]}